# perception_cheese (kenshi-k16.5.17, rebuilt k16.5.20 from rwh.191, findings/perception_cheese_mourn_hold.md): the user's cheese spot at Mourn, Abandoned HQ
# (Ancient Lab). The Great White Gorillo (98509-rebirth.mod, faction Wildlife) stands at his home (12519, 1192, 65674) inside the tower; one player character, a
# Ranger with a crossbow and Bolts [Regulars], stands on the tower ring behind the wall at (12365, 1186, 65658), 154 u away, holding the ranged attack on him
# with HOLD. Live: the ranged task pays Perception and Crossbows XP on its range test before the line-of-sight decision, and a ranged attacker the gorillo
# cannot see is never on his target list, so he never leaves and no bolt lands. Gorillos are neutral to the player here (relation 0, the save); the test
# makes the squad hostile for its second case. Only the player is ever ordered (SCENARIO_IMPORT.md "Rule").
# Open questions, deferred: playtesting: Perception 1.0 start (live 16.9; the template's own is used).
